flowchart LR
    subgraph Start[Ways to start or stop]
        Home[Home card: Record screen]
        Dock[Floating dock button]
        Tray[Tray: Record Screen]
        Voice["Shortcut + 'say less start recording'"]
    end
    Setup["Recording setup (Home panel, or the dock's setup button)<br/>screen or one window, mic + which mic, computer sound,<br/>webcam + camera, corner, size, 720p/1080p/native, 30/60 fps"]
    Setup -->|save_recording_options| Store[(recording.json<br/>defaults: whole screen, mic, sound, 1080p30)]
    Voice --> Match[studio.rs recording_cue, checked before custom actions, nothing pasted]
    Home --> Cmd
    Dock --> Cmd
    Tray --> Cmd
    Match --> Cmd[Rust screen_recorder: start / stop / status]
    Store --> Cmd
    Cmd -->|a permission the setup needs is missing: screen, mic, camera| Denied[Plain message + Open System Settings]
    Cmd -->|macOS 15+| Swift[Swift bridge: ScreenCaptureKit SCRecordingOutput]
    Swift -->|webcam on| Bubble[Round camera window, always on top, draggable.<br/>The filter leaves out Say Less windows except this one]
    Cmd -->|Windows, Linux, macOS below 15| Off[Button and setup disabled with a reason. Windows is phase 2]
    Swift --> File["~/Movies/Say Less/Say Less YYYY-MM-DD at HH.MM.SS.mp4<br/>H.264 + AAC (mic mixed with system audio), face burned in"]
    Bubble --> File
    Cmd -->|screen-recording-changed event| UI[Every window and the tray update: red dot, mm:ss, Saved, Show in Finder]
